SUMMARY:Summer Solstice Mini Retreat: Bloom into Summer
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 20th (rain date June 27th) 1:30 PM – 4:00 PM \nJoin Jodi Brooks and Jennifer Hondru for an afternoon of yoga\, meditation\, and mindfulness while connecting with nature in the beautiful Van Vleck gardens. Together we will blend mindful movement and constructive rest with breath and meditation to embrace and welcome the seasonal shift into summer. This mini-retreat will include… \n~ Intention setting for the season ahead \n~ A Yoga practice to build strength & balance\, cultivate calm & cool\, and allow self care with rest & relaxation \n~ Guided movement\, breathing practices\, and meditation \n~ A mindful walk through the magnificent Van Vleck gardens \n~ Nourishing tea and snacks \n~ An opportunity for meaningful connection with others. \nPlease bring a mat\, and an open mind and heart. Registration required; there are no drop-ins for this class. \nFee: $50 for Members\, $65 for General Public \n \nSponsored by:
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/summer-solstice-mini-retreat-bloom-into-summer/
CATEGORIES:Classes,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/03/DSC_2102-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
