SUMMARY:Cats in the Garden Jaguar Show
DESCRIPTION:  \nThis popular Father’s Day event brings families from all over to admire the classic and contemporary Jaguar automobiles from the Jaguar Touring Club of New Jersey. \nAdmission is $10 cash per person at the gate\, kids under age 10 may enter free of charge. There is no registration for this event. The rain date is the following Sunday\, June 28 at the same time. \nPlease contact Paul Maletsky of the Jaguar Touring Club if you have questions about the Club.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/cats-in-the-garden-jaguar-show/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Holiday Event,Children,Adults,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2026/01/Cats-in-the-Garden-2026_social-graphic.png
END:VEVENT
