SUMMARY:Nature Explorers
DESCRIPTION:Nature Explorers \nJune 27\, July 18\, August 1 & 15\, 10:30AM – 12:30PM \nIntroducing our new family program\, Nature Explorers. This is a free program offered on select Saturdays. Each session will be host to a different garden or nature inspired activity such as\, planting in our Kitchen Garden\, creating and adding to a community art project\, seasonal scavenger hunts\, bird watching\, and much more! Summer sessions are weather permitting as activities will be held fully outdoors. \nFee: Free\, pre-registration is encouraged. \n \n 
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/nature-explorers/2026-07-18/
